{"kProb":{"title":"概率分布与期望","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">每种结果一个概率，全部加起来等于 1；期望 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[X]=\\sum_x x\\,p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 是按概率加权的平均。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K3\">数学 · 概率与信息</a> › <b>概率分布与期望</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"tryit\"><b>🧪 动手试试：</b><button class=\"btn primary\" data-jump=\"labSoftmax\" data-lv=\"K3\">🧪 softmax 与交叉熵（概率与信息）</button></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>大模型每一步输出的就是“下一个词元”的概率分布。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>方差 Var(X)=E[X²]−(E[X])² 衡量离散程度；独立变量的方差可以相加（√dₖ 缩放要用）。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>语言本来就有不确定性：同一句话后面可以接很多个词。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>期望是线性的：E[aX+bY]=aE[X]+bE[Y]，不需要独立，所以很多推导能一步完成。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：本站只讲离散情形；连续情形把求和换成积分。</p></div><!--m2pi--><div class=\"sn\"><p class=\"sn-h\"><span>🔤 这里用到的符号</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-all\" data-sym=\"*\">📖 全部符号</button></p><ul class=\"sn-l\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"E\">𝔼</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“期望”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“平均来看大概是多少”：把每种情况的结果，按它出现的机会大小加权平均。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>X</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“X”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">一个“随机的数”：还没掷的骰子，掷完才知道是几</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sum\">Σ</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“西格玛”（求和）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“把一串东西全部加起来”。下面写从第几个开始，上面写加到第几个；下面只写一个字母时，就是把它取遍所有可能的编号，全部加起来。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>x</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“x”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">一个可能出现的结果（比如骰子掷出的点数）</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"mul\">□□</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：不用读出来：挨着写就是乘</span><span class=\"sn-m\">两个东西紧挨着写、中间没有符号，表示相乘：比如数字后面紧跟一个字母，就是这个数乘它；两个括号挨着，就是两个括号相乘。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>p</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“p”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">p(x)：结果 x 出现的机会有多大（0 到 1 之间）</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"fx\">□( )</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“……括号……”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">把括号里的东西放进前面那台“机器”（函数），得到的结果。就像自动售货机：投进去一样东西，掉出来一个结果。</span></li></ul></div><!--/m2pi-->"},"kBayes":{"title":"条件概率与贝叶斯","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(A\\mid B)=\\frac{P(B\\mid A)\\,P(A)}{P(B)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>：看到证据 B 之后，A 的可能性怎样更新。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K3\">数学 · 概率与信息</a> › <b>条件概率与贝叶斯</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>概率的链式法则 P(x₁…xₙ)=∏P(xₜ|x₍<ₜ₎) 正是“逐词预测”的数学形式。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>先验 × 似然，再归一化。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>两种方式写同一个联合概率 P(A∩B)，一除就得到贝叶斯公式。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>它能纠正直觉：本站的检测例子里，阳性者真正患病的概率只有约 17%。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：结果依赖先验；先验估错，后验也会错。</p></div><!--m2pi--><div class=\"sn\"><p class=\"sn-h\"><span>🔤 这里用到的符号</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-all\" data-sym=\"*\">📖 全部符号</button></p><ul class=\"sn-l\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>P</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“P”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">一件事发生的机会有多大（0 到 1 之间）</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"fx\">□( )</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“……括号……”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">把括号里的东西放进前面那台“机器”（函数），得到的结果。就像自动售货机：投进去一样东西，掉出来一个结果。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>A</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“A”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">一件事（比如“生病了”）</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"mid\">|</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“在……的条件下”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">竖线右边是已经知道的情况，左边是想知道的事：“在知道右边的情况下，左边发生的机会”。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>B</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“B”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">另一件事（比如“检测结果是阳性”）</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"frac\">▭⁄▭</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“下面分之上面”（分数线）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">横线上面的数除以横线下面的数。½ 就是 1 除以 2，也就是一半。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"mul\">□□</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：不用读出来：挨着写就是乘</span><span class=\"sn-m\">两个东西紧挨着写、中间没有符号，表示相乘：比如数字后面紧跟一个字母，就是这个数乘它；两个括号挨着，就是两个括号相乘。</span></li></ul></div><!--/m2pi-->"},"kSoft":{"title":"softmax","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">把任意一组分数 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span> 变成概率：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i=e^{z_i}/\\sum_j e^{z_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K3\">数学 · 概率与信息</a> › <b>softmax</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"tryit\"><b>🧪 动手试试：</b><button class=\"btn primary\" data-jump=\"labSoftmax\" data-lv=\"K3\">🧪 softmax 与交叉熵（概率与信息）</button></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>结果都为正、加起来等于 1，分数越高概率越大。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>输出层给每个词元一个分数，softmax 变成概率；注意力里把打分变成权重。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>所有分数加同一个常数，结果不变（本站有证明）；所以实际计算时先减去最大值，避免 e 的指数溢出。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>和交叉熵配合时，梯度化简成 p − y（见“推导与证明”）。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：分数差得很大时输出接近 0/1，梯度几乎为 0（饱和）。</p></div><!--m2pi--><div class=\"sn\"><p class=\"sn-h\"><span>🔤 这里用到的符号</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-all\" data-sym=\"*\">📖 全部符号</button></p><ul class=\"sn-l\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>z</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“z”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">打分：模型给每个选项打的原始分</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>p</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“p”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">变成的“机会”：每个选项被选中的可能性</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sub\">□₁</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“下标”（右下角的小字）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">右下角的小字是“编号”或“标签”，用来区分同一类的好几个东西：编号 1、编号 2 就是第 1 个、第 2 个。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>i</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“i”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">编号：第几个选项</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"euler\">e</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“e”（自然常数）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">一个特别的数，约等于 2.718。它在“增长”和“变化”的计算里最方便，就像圆周率是和圆有关的特别的数。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sup\">□²</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“……次方”（右上角的小字）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">右上角的小数字表示“自己乘自己几次”：3² = 3×3 = 9，2³ = 2×2×2 = 8。负的次方表示“倒过来”：2⁻¹ = ½。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"slash\">/</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“除以”（斜线）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">除号的另一种写法：6/3 就是 6÷3 = 2。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sum\">Σ</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“西格玛”（求和）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“把一串东西全部加起来”。下面写从第几个开始，上面写加到第几个；下面只写一个字母时，就是把它取遍所有可能的编号，全部加起来。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>j</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“j”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">编号：用来把所有选项挨个数一遍</span></li></ul></div><!--/m2pi-->"},"kEnt":{"title":"熵与交叉熵","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\">熵 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(p)=-\\sum p\\log p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span> 衡量不确定性；交叉熵 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(p,q)=-\\sum p\\log q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span> 衡量“用 q 去猜 p”有多差。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K3\">数学 · 概率与信息</a> › <b>熵与交叉熵</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"tryit\"><b>🧪 动手试试：</b><button class=\"btn primary\" data-jump=\"labSoftmax\" data-lv=\"K3\">🧪 softmax 与交叉熵（概率与信息）</button></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>语言模型的损失就是交叉熵：正确词元概率的负对数 −log q(正确词元)。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>正确词元的概率从 0.5 提到 0.9，损失从 0.69 降到 0.11（自然对数）。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>H(p,q)=H(p)+KL(p‖q)：数据的熵是固定的，降低交叉熵就是让模型分布靠近数据分布。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>对数把连乘的概率变成相加，长文本也能稳定计算。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：交叉熵低不等于回答正确有用，只表示“像训练数据”。</p></div><!--m2pi--><div class=\"sn\"><p class=\"sn-h\"><span>🔤 这里用到的符号</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-all\" data-sym=\"*\">📖 全部符号</button></p><ul class=\"sn-l\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>H</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“H”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">H(p)：p 自己的平均意外；H(p, q)：结果按 p 出现、却按 q 去猜时的平均意外</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"fx\">□( )</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“……括号……”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">把括号里的东西放进前面那台“机器”（函数），得到的结果。就像自动售货机：投进去一样东西，掉出来一个结果。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>p</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“p”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“真实的”猜测：每个结果出现的机会有多大</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sum\">Σ</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“西格玛”（求和）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“把一串东西全部加起来”。下面写从第几个开始，上面写加到第几个；下面只写一个字母时，就是把它取遍所有可能的编号，全部加起来。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"log\">log</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“对数”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“底数要乘几次方才能得到这个数”：log₁₀ 100 = 2，因为 10² = 100。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>q</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“q”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">另一种猜测：拿来和 p 比较、或者去模仿 p 的那一个</span></li></ul></div><!--/m2pi-->"},"kKL":{"title":"KL 散度","mc":"#15803d","body":"<div class=\"m-meta\"><p class=\"role\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{KL}(p\\Vert q)=\\sum p\\log\\frac{p}{q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">KL</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2311em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span>：两个分布差多远，永远 ≥ 0，相等时为 0。</p><div class=\"where\">📍 所在位置：<a data-go=\"T1\">应用全景</a> › <a data-go=\"T2\">Agent</a> › <a data-go=\"T3\">大模型</a> › <a data-go=\"N\">神经网络入门</a> › <a data-go=\"K3\">数学 · 概率与信息</a> › <b>KL 散度</b></div><span class=\"status no\">📐 数学基础：不是一个部件，而是部件背后的计算规则</span></div><div class=\"m-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"卡片分栏\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t0\" aria-controls=\"mt@p0\" aria-selected=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\">🎯 作用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t1\" aria-controls=\"mt@p1\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">▶ 怎么用</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t2\" aria-controls=\"mt@p2\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">🧠 为什么</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" id=\"mt@t3\" aria-controls=\"mt@p3\" aria-selected=\"false\" tabindex=\"-1\">⚠️ 局限</button></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p0\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t0\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"sec\"><h4>🎯 作用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>RLHF 里用 KL 约束新模型不要离原模型太远。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p1\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t1\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec\" style=\"background:#f0f9ff\"><h4>▶ 怎么用</h4><ul class=\"pts\"><li>它不对称：KL(p‖q) 一般不等于 KL(q‖p)。</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p2\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t2\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><div class=\"sec why\"><h4>🧠 为什么这么设计（底层逻辑）</h4><p>“≥ 0”由不等式 ln t ≤ t − 1 一步得到（本站有完整证明）。</p></div><div class=\"sec eff\"><h4>✅ 为什么这样做就有效</h4><p>因为 KL ≥ 0，均匀分布的熵 log n 是所有 n 种结果分布中最大的。</p></div></div><div class=\"m-panel\" id=\"mt@p3\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"mt@t3\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden=\"\"><p class=\"lim\">⚠️ 局限/说明：q 在 p>0 的地方为 0 时，KL 为无穷大。</p></div><!--m2pi--><div class=\"sn\"><p class=\"sn-h\"><span>🔤 这里用到的符号</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-all\" data-sym=\"*\">📖 全部符号</button></p><ul class=\"sn-l\"><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"word\">KL</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“KL”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">KL 散度：量一量两种猜测差了多少</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"fx\">□( )</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“……括号……”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">把括号里的东西放进前面那台“机器”（函数），得到的结果。就像自动售货机：投进去一样东西，掉出来一个结果。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>p</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“p”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“真实的”猜测：每个结果出现的机会有多大</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"parallel\">∥</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“相对于”（把两样东西隔开）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">双竖线把要比较的两个分布隔开：左边是“真实的”，右边是“拿来近似它的”。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"var\"><i>q</i></button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“q”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">另一种猜测：拿来和 p 比较、或者去模仿 p 的那一个</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"sum\">Σ</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“西格玛”（求和）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“把一串东西全部加起来”。下面写从第几个开始，上面写加到第几个；下面只写一个字母时，就是把它取遍所有可能的编号，全部加起来。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"log\">log</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“对数”</span><span class=\"sn-m\">“底数要乘几次方才能得到这个数”：log₁₀ 100 = 2，因为 10² = 100。</span></li><li><button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-s\" data-sym=\"frac\">▭⁄▭</button><span class=\"sn-r\">读作：“下面分之上面”（分数线）</span><span class=\"sn-m\">横线上面的数除以横线下面的数。½ 就是 1 除以 2，也就是一半。</span></li></ul></div><!--/m2pi-->"}}
